# Agent session state. This repo is public and renders as the GitHub profile,
# so nothing a coding session leaves behind belongs in it.
#
# .claude/taste-signals.jsonl in particular is a verbatim log of prompts typed
# during a session. Not secret, but not profile content either, and the kind of
# thing that gets committed by accident with a `git add -A`.
.claude/

.DS_Store
